      "width": 460,
      "height": 320
    },
    {
      "id": "node_m02",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🏛️ M02: Campo Eléctrico y Dipolos\n**Ecuación Fundamental:**\n$$\\vec{E} = \\frac{\\vec{F}_0}{q_0}, \\quad \\vec{\\tau} = \\vec{p} \\times \\vec{E}$$\n\n- 📝 [[Taller_2_Campo]]\n- 🖥️ [[Deck_M02_Campo]]\n- 🧪 [[Simulador_VectorFieldLab]]\n- 📄 [[Cap02_Guia]]",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "img_guia_m02",
